Release: Gates

Purpose:
  Defines release gate and deployment verification rules.

GateSchema:
  Format: RELEASE-GATE-<ID>
  Condition: All required gates = PASSED
  Evidence: Gate results
  Owner: Release Manager
  Decision: APPROVED / BLOCKED

ReleaseChain:
  TASK → GATES → EVIDENCE → RESULT → RELEASE

ReleaseNode:
  Format: REL-YYYY-NNN
  Links to: TASKS, GATES, COMMIT, BUILD, IMAGE, DEPLOYMENT, ENVIRONMENT

DeploymentVerification:
  DEPLOY → SMOKE TEST → HEALTH CHECK → METRICS → ERROR RATE → VERIFY

AutomaticRollback:
  Trigger: Error rate ↑, Latency ↑, Healthcheck FAIL
  Action: Release → Rollback policy

DeploymentStrategies:
  Small: Direct deployment
  Medium: Rolling
  Large: Canary
  Critical: Blue/Green

Rules:
  [RS1] Release is APPROVED only when all required gates pass.
  [RS2] Deployment verification MUST run after deploy.
  [RS3] Automatic rollback MUST trigger on health check failure.
  [RS4] Deployment strategy is selected based on project scale.

State: +